    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25360" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Jūra</span></b> , ae (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Jūres</span></b> , ĭum,
